%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD%E8%8E%B2\" title=\"玛丽莲\"><img alt=\"玛丽莲\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-301101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-301101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD%E8%8E%B2\" title=\"玛丽莲\">玛丽莲</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>线与数之间</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301103</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">《快乐爱情》《娱乐至上》……出演的大热作品越多，来自好莱坞的注视便愈发疯狂。老板们端着一杯杯天价美酒接踵而来，各路经纪人争破头想要得到一个站在她身边的位置。而她总是望向窗外，内心只想拥有一刻属于自己的宁静。<br />在远海的另一边，如世外桃源般的小岛上，一切却截然相反。学者会以手中的笔与尺规丈量她的美，孩童们簇拥而来，想要听关于实数的故事。人们依然为她着迷，但并非源于金钱、名气或足以见报的桃色新闻，而是源于她完美的身体比例所体现的和谐美学。<br />她意识到，这里只有对数字与真理的渴求。自己所熟悉的、日夜栖身的那片纸醉金迷，在小岛上则如幻梦般无关紧要。<br />于是她继续出演，这次的剧本是《维纳斯的传道》。<br />宛如维纳斯的布道一般，此刻她自身的存在，正是“黄金分割”这一美学原理显现的最佳铁证。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1e/Belonging-301104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">矩形衣袍<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Rectangular Toga</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />34<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>织金描边的矩形长袍，搭配湖色披肩。如此朴素的裁剪，是为了凸显穿戴者的曼妙。数学家都知道，最完美的公式，只需要一方白纸来衬托。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/59/Belonging-301105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">传道者百合<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Orator's Lilies</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>两朵洁白的百合花，优雅自然，应当来自清晨的湖畔。“它们或许在傍晚就会枯萎，但这一天能聆听布道，就已经足够了。”这段话似乎透露了受访者的哲学理念。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/30/Belonging-301106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">一组饰物<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">A Set of Accessories</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一组由钦慕者赠送的饰品。被打磨得光滑细致，绝不会刮伤佩戴者的肌肤。据说，设计它们的是位数学家，因而在每一处弯弧，每一处折角中，都蕴含了最深奥的数学公式。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 维纳斯的传道1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%931.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 维纳斯的传道2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%BB%B4%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%81%932.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">维纳斯的传道 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Preaching of Venus</small></span></span>"}}